{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"“We have five of the artifacts to restore the gods. Goanhawe has confessed his sins, and the Golden Dawn has lost all of its members. There’s hope yet.”","created_at":"2020-07-31T19:00:53.104000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738833583220981962","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
